    q("dx_015","Clientes sin actividad en los ultimos 6 meses","Cuantos clientes no han comprado en los ultimos 6 meses?","Clientes en CLIENTE que no aparecen en DOCCAB TIPO=13 de los ultimos 180 dias.","SELECT COUNT(*) AS N_CLIENTES_INACTIVOS FROM CLIENTE WHERE (BAJA IS NULL OR BAJA!=1) AND CODIGO NOT IN (SELECT DISTINCT CODCLIENTE FROM DOCCAB WHERE TIPO=13 AND FECHA>=date('now','-180 days') AND CODCLIENTE IS NOT NULL)","NULL","Director","KPI","Alto","",""),
